[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="TheTwoThrones" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(0, -470)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Thrones"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Two seats on the dais[/b]

The King's throne is gilded and small, its cushion barely dented. A painted wooden soldier has been pushed down between the cushion and the arm, where a boy might hide it during a long audience.

Beside it stands a plain chair of dark oak with no crown on it. Its armrests are worn pale where a man's hands have gripped them, every day, for four years."
reexamine_text = "The small gilded throne, and the worn oak chair beside it."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/TheTwoThrones"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_220x50")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/TheTwoThrones"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Look at the Thrones"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="CouncilMap" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-480, -132)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Study the Council Map"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The regency council's map[/b]

The Western Valley is drawn in loving detail. Beside each village, three years of tithe figures, every one struck through and written smaller. Thornhaven's are the worst.

A single pin is stuck into the Darkwood, its little flag inked [i]Iron Hollow[/i]. In the margin, in a heavy, upright hand: \"[i]A rope is cheap. What would it cost to own them?[/i]\""
reexamine_text = "A pin in the Darkwood, and a question in the margin."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/CouncilMap"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_220x48")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/CouncilMap"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Study the Council Map"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="UnopenedPetitions" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(600, -200)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Petitions"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The petition chest[/b]

It is full past closing. On top, a letter with Thornhaven's council seal, still unbroken, its ribbon gone grey with dust:
\"[i]To his Grace the Lord Protector, from the council of Thornhaven, humbly, a fourth time...[/i]\"

The clerk's docket tied to it reads only: [i]Western Valley. Defer.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "Thornhaven's fourth petition, never opened."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/UnopenedPetitions"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_160x48")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/UnopenedPetitions"]
